:"Presentation tools"},{"text":"Clinical documentation systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Valuable"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tele-rehabilitation platforms"},{"text":"Motion-analysis systems"},{"text":"Wearable sensors"},{"text":"Digital exercise platforms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced/Optional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Computer vision"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"IoT"},{"text":"These are particularly useful for professionals interested in digital physiotherapy and rehabilitation technology."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Assessment Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong Clinical Physiotherapist should be able to perform structured assessment rather than relying only on symptoms."},{"type":"h","text":"Common Assessment Areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient history"},{"text":"Pain"},{"text":"Range of motion"},{"text":"Muscle strength"},{"text":"Posture"},{"text":"Gait"},{"text":"Balance"},{"text":"Functional mobility"},{"text":"Cardiopulmonary response"},{"text":"Activity limitations"},{"text":"Participation restrictions"},{"text":"Use appropriate validated outcome measures for the relevant condition."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Projects During BPT"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Musculoskeletal Assessment Tool"},{"type":"p","text":"Create an educational prototype covering:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Patient Complaint","History","Pain Assessment","ROM","Strength","Functional Assessment","Outcome Measure"]},{"type":"p","text":"The tool should be educational and should not be treated as an autonomous diagnostic system."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Gait Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cadence"},{"text":"Step length"},{"text":"Walking speed"},{"text":"Symmetry"},{"text":"Balance"},{"text":"Gait deviations"},{"text":"Video-based analysis can be used with consent and de-identified/synthetic cases."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Digi